---
title: Newsletter page
layout: home
description: One issue, as it was sent — the number and the date above the title, the letter itself at the reading width, and the way to join at the end for whoever arrived from a link.
eyebrow: Collections · Newsletter
source: src/components/collection.css · content.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap im-pt-sm im-section-sm">
	<p class="im-eyebrow">Collections · Newsletter · {{page.title}}</p>
	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-wrap-wide" style="margin-bottom: 2rem">
	{{#with demo.issues.[0]}}
	<header class="im-letterhead im-grid-start">
		<div class="im-stack im-stack-sm">
			<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron"><li><a href="/">{{> "icons/house"}}<span>Home</span></a></li><li><a href="/collections/newsletter/">{{> "icons/mail"}}<span>Field Notes</span></a></li><li><span aria-current="page">#{{n}}</span></li></ol></nav>
			<h1 class="im-collhead-title">{{title}}</h1>
			<p class="im-lede im-m0">{{text}}</p>
			<p class="im-collhead-meta"><span>{{sent}}</span><span>{{words}} words</span><span>{{read}} opened</span></p>
			<div class="im-max-sm">{{> "components/subscribe" id="letter-email" button="Get the next one"}}</div>
			<p class="im-letterhead-note">{{> "icons/mail"}}This page went out as an email to 4,210 people on {{sent}}.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="im-letterhead-shot"><img src="{{lookup ../demo.shots shot}}" alt="" loading="eager"></div>
	</header>
	{{/with}}
</div>

<div class="im-single im-wrap-wide" data-sidebar="on">
	<article class="im-stack im-stack-md">
		<section class="im-content im-content-flush im-center" data-toc-skip>
			<details class="im-toc-inline im-block im-max-md im-mx-auto">
				<summary>In this letter <span>Contents</span></summary>
				<div class="im-toc" data-toc="#letter"></div>
			</details>
		</section>
		<section class="im-content im-content-flush im-content-lede" id="letter">
			<p>Hello from Amsterdam. This is the one where I deleted the theme this site ran on, and what that cost — in hours, in euros and in one licence clause I should have read first.</p>
			<h2>What I built</h2>
			<p>A design system I own every line of, and a theme on top of it. Nine months. The two-line audit that proves nothing came with me from the old theme returns empty, which is the whole point.</p>
			<h2>What it cost</h2>
			<p>About four hundred hours, most of them evenings. Two rewrites. One argument with myself about a second skin, which I lost, and then won by deleting it.</p>
			<h2>What I got wrong</h2>
			<p>I built for pages that never existed. Everything I regret is a component no real page needed. Pick twenty, write them properly, add the twenty-first when a page asks for it.</p>
			<h2>Three links</h2>
			<ul><li><a href="/collections/project/page/">The project, as a case study.</a></li><li><a href="/collections/snippets/page/">The one snippet from this that I use daily.</a></li><li><a href="/collections/travel/trip/">The trip that made the film.</a></li></ul>
			<p>Reply to this email if you want; I read all of them.</p>
		</section>
		{{> "components/comments" thread=demo.comments count="18" lean=true limit="1"}}
	</article>
	<aside>
		<div class="im-sticky-rail">
			<div class="im-widgets">
				{{#with demo.author}}{{> "components/author" status="Open to work"}}{{/with}}
				<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="l-prev">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="l-prev">Earlier letters <a href="/collections/newsletter/">All</a></h2>
					<ul class="im-widget-list im-widget-list-thumbs">
						{{#each demo.issues}}{{#match @index ">" 0}}<li><a href="/collections/newsletter/issue/">{{#if shot}}<img src="{{lookup ../demo.shots shot}}" alt="" loading="lazy">{{else}}<img src="{{lookup ../demo.shots 2}}" alt="" loading="lazy">{{/if}}{{title}}<small>#{{n}} · {{sent}}</small></a></li>{{/match}}{{/each}}
					</ul>
				</section>
				<section class="im-widget im-widget-fill" aria-labelledby="l-sub">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="l-sub">Get the next one</h2>
					<p class="im-widget-heading">Free. One letter when something lands.</p>
					{{> "components/subscribe" id="letter-email-2" button="Join"}}
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</aside>
</div>

<section class="im-section im-wrap"><div class="im-prose">
<p>A letter's head is the same two columns as the collection's: the title, what it is, the numbers and a subscribe box on the left; the letter's picture on the right; and a line saying it went out as an email, because it did. The contents sit centred and collapsed above the body; the rail carries the author, earlier letters and the box again.</p>
</div></section>
